#NEXUS

[ novas2012a_fig7: Coelurosaur time tree, root at the bottom. The backbone nodes are 4-6 px apart along the foot of the figure; each was read from a listing of the horizontal line segments, as was the Dilong / Eotyrannus / (Tyrannosaurus, Gorgosaurus) step hidden behind the range bars. Internal labels as printed: COELUROSAURIA (leader line) and the abbreviations Allo., Tyrann., Comps. and Mani., each printed just right of the stem it names; Mani. therefore marks the node that includes Ornitholestes. 29 tips, 3 polytomies (3, 6, 4 children); 5 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=29;
    TAXLABELS
        Piatnitzkysaurus_floresi
        Mapusaurus_roseae
        Allosaurus_fragilis
        Sinraptor_dongi
        Tugulusaurus_faciles
        Bicentenaria_argentina
